OL,3,GNEWSASuspects identified over rooftop
OL,4,Arock throwing
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice investigating reports of moss,
OL,7,Fmud and rocks being thrown from
OL,8,Frooftops towards pedestrians and
OL,9,Fvehicles in Melton Mowbray town centre
OL,10,Fhave identified suspects.
OL,12,FLeicestershire Police said in a social
OL,13,Fmedia post there had been a
OL,14,F"significant increase" in anti-social
OL,15,Fbehaviour in recent weeks and added it
OL,16,Fwould be carrying out extra patrols.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
