OL,3,GNEWSASuspects identified over rooftop
OL,4,Arock throwing
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe force said it had received 20
OL,7,Freports of anti-social behaviour in
OL,8,FSeptember and October in the area, with
OL,9,Freports concentrated around High
OL,10,FStreet, Sherrard Street, Windsor Street
OL,11,Fand the Bell Centre.
OL,13,FOfficers said a group of youths were
OL,14,Fbelieved to be responsible and work was
OL,15,Fongoing to "prevent further offending".
